{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1337,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cdcb3a9cab936a5855cb4bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道你是个很努力的人，但是……\r\n有烦恼的时候不要自己独自承受，\r\n也让我一起分担吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e4d763b5c10aae8c213ceb0bad7bf66b9ea0689086cde0d48b4fc413aee328a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0398a84b2bd40995da4c1f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "念绘本给托儿所的小朋友听的时候，\r\n是还需要加上演技的……哇啊～！\r\n呵呵，鬼来了哦～恐怖吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91690653fad98360d13b34f85154023f7364418b72b24283260d2325c9e0c68c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eecd91fec81af8dbab8a78c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服上充满着什么样的心意呢～\r\n呵呵，可不能辜负那些心意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a221e82aebfa6272e35d43c34ff7e72cd97f1092c59b6395bf70875a2bb797",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f8fb6a5e178e5b3c9f43f2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然可以穿着一样的衣服\r\n登上舞台……\r\n呵呵，要好好练舞才行呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c820fb5f577bf5bef1e853aebaebfd7965eeb3205c0561493a80905d0a821a99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:264379aaf64e0421230b1766",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是怎样的比赛都没问题的。\r\n只要有你的期望，平静安稳的溪流\r\n也能变成气势磅礡的大河。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ee641aa097fc4160a88d3de58bfe52ec3a2ecc7b8c472d0137c6d2d3621c60d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba70707d1bdbb7c7ec7e2ad6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手帕、卫生纸、\r\n裁缝针线、外伤药……\r\n果然有包包还是比较方便呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1f6920c0059a39ba3ae1f9a4cc2260dfe3525bee03622df04267b7e9872274e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f2e7c804da71e0cd149d386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原本想要溺爱一下\r\n还没睡醒的训练员来着……\r\n呵呵呵，今天怎么了呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fb80c89b76530353bce87f05a4d4e7c5b029a8461d6c22c0cf81220aaf361c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67932a0aef7f288e9c008c39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的行程已经决定好了吗？\r\n啊，你不用着急哦～\r\n我们一起慢慢想吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7083c3c21a66967b76689eafabe2882bfb421cbad5837fc44b162561bcddfa6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb3b90f95da04e493be86e5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡不着的时候我会为你唱摇篮曲的，\r\n不要客气尽管跟我说哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c7f7bd673bd78e1a4ac72d079c473eb760cbe73e0d19d43e6e16100b5d177dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66e9c170aa80dc65533a4242",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天的朝气给人有种随时都会有\r\n开心的事情发生的感觉……\r\n呵呵，会感到很期待呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "795e633d4160f80ad16e4a68ce00a2f5e8eaf6243511f388ad046c9f5871e219",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:389dc80cfed8030cdda078e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天真的不能没有毛巾呢～\r\n因为有擦不完的汗水嘛……呼。\r\n还是干脆直接换衣服算了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7218fadf2a45d5643b2c275e5547209145d2346eda18638a9450ed09b7d4b32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:048874618737fa129e739b88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食欲、读书、运动……\r\n训练员觉得秋天最适合做什么呢？\r\n……该不会是想被宠爱的秋天？\r\n呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ee155da1da4ea2f0a85e57af5b02cce879cb08be519afc8a56e79139c2cbabb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:893800c1b4d839ca6f10e503",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有乖乖在戴手套吗？\r\n为了避免冻伤，\r\n一定要做好手的保暖哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ae400ba4b286147760daa8bafaf7408357f0bdf9302736622fc5e91ff6c33c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92593d6e4ddc6b4d903e82a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "孩子们开心得到处跑来跑去……\r\n呵呵，万圣节\r\n是个很能照顾他人的节日呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5562cb58e9eac71c5937fe362ccd3a5001d3909afa8419f32d3985c68bcf6d66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:950957b4c9c988522987f33b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喂每一个人吃点心后，\r\n被小玉说\r\n「这个万圣节也太奇怪了！」♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a554742247bb417c2c74765cf6babed202748abf55197bd1ea5a57287185bc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdad3440491e0ef082d548f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为有小荒帮忙准备资料，\r\n才能完成这套服装。\r\n称赞她一次根本不够呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8b422febbe432555dbc93084131a21318112b02554bd22939c5d601dc59e7c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e00196ad84f1528cc6e10920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "认真的小波总是很努力，\r\n非常可爱呢～\r\n让人很想称赞她♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b61ed99ea89d1acdda5ff1bca44e19978396608939a653310b502777ed378b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b42c289db7a86341998d1e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要给米米点心，\r\n她就会高兴到眼睛发亮。\r\n得再准备点心才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "06fe507e70e0fa851dd960e0ad37e43576bb96e1456c8ad65b43cf092d8dbe17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c03dad40c2a0e961f2fd91ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果做了恶梦\r\n还请尽管跟我说。\r\nMummy会好好安慰你的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "83d3935e7bb76c262ee2d2bdecdd997802ae25047e69c455656c9448a914b078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f9d8dfe4c1510d306281b08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还没到吃点心的时间，\r\n但是……你可以先吃一个♪\r\n要对大家保密喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b4c2201cbab84ee8070ec475c26d472d3af787ec11a55eb882f846c6b688525",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d7fcc7e44a4dd49f18da7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有光线的地方\r\n似乎能睡得比较好。\r\n像是……棺木里面之类的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52473ab97d7fdc2fff2553340b2b1288862341ec0c90a8e896e7d7a359d122a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:887e383bc4e9e5126928a78a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀，好像困了呢～\r\n毕竟这个季节很舒适，\r\n请听我的摇篮曲尽管入睡吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c3206d1e0955444061b24cd269b993feb50cdad2ec044e23222691001d8e10d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bcb9015d499330d37412578",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对木乃伊来说也很炎热呢～\r\n有好好补充水分吗？\r\n我帮你拿水过来喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69cc2a391290a036951f09b73fd22a746e48a9432eae9677078969cf2a03cd33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bf4ad40bdafea493dd3269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员要变装的话……\r\n可以扮成妖怪或殭尸也很好……\r\n嗯～干脆全部都做一套吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f6f5d54f45a11c25bc020a8b19b555ca69f1bb97d4a211b9d25f942e6905328",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcec62fdb26ad301147ab71d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风好冷呢。\r\n把我的绷带当作围巾，\r\n要不要一起围在脖子上呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b967c4c2da1f91f98723f4a9f2bee65d8ef909708119585f04162d1019d0dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca8cf8a72964d24531d82c09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Mummy是永不消逝的存在。\r\n所以……\r\n可以永远照顾大家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c61b68a3578a6547bfa33b20ec8740bb19e47f9d44b63f7a12a4353ae0417485",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:976f664a872494670529bf81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受伤了还请告诉我。\r\n我的每一处绷带\r\n都可以尽情使用喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d9cfb0142b4110a8ec26b934828c32cc0ff2c370b5c613b56e178344de8245f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c075c3ad45383f00ebe6c690",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抜き足～差し足～…ふふ、隠れ身の\r\n術の特訓中なんです。照れ屋の子も\r\nこっそりお世話できたらなって♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fac8ffdd6c62fe010f4fecf5e03f917c72a63a36c25d06d9823d2f8c03ced8f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb32219b21a26d410f4515c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "困り事はないでござるか？…ふふ、\r\n今度ヤエノちゃんと託児所で戦国\r\nショーをするので、役作りです♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dab01878a664ab56bc6497bc160e20911a064d4e2f28560a23159fc5f5886158",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3c421f138dca9814769ace1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ノーリーズンちゃん、尻尾の毛並み\r\n整えてあげたら『苦しゅうない！』\r\nって♪ふふ、やりがいがあります～",
      "source_fingerprint": "35e40d39bbe82e776b4c25f3f609ce63dbd0ca6718bcc875883893fd10aaa6b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85d9e3982af4f2dfd5a24ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミラ子ちゃん、いいこですよね～。\r\n私のことも、たまに『お母さん』\r\nって呼んでくれますし…かわいい♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ef603efd1c68a3f2c2de44118968b26adf41db5c39c18ece3e5bb8c0352391",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7014576017b8b20b2bd3e25d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タイシンちゃんがゲームに集中\r\nしてる時は忍び足。たまに小声で\r\n『よし』って言うのもかわいくて♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0fb092760d9e85236c6570fe22b81f8407e157ed91e9402407a8339f593cf22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc282374b47b4e6d5f06688d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まんまるお団子ヘアーですよ～。\r\nかわいく仕上がるのが嬉しくて、\r\n朝の準備も楽しみなんです♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "764a76b8a6295c65ff708c342152a47d26cb62d762eb7e119f43c462dd0f794b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1ee7214063358b4388e0090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午後のおやつは何を食べたい\r\nですか？飴におもちに金平糖…\r\n巾着袋に色々ありますからね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "67721d6a958d3e2316a3b0da7f76d7717eaa69bc6c6b6be81707fc04c375853d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc552a608a12831558b8b93d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まあっ！おやすみの前に会いにきて\r\nくれたんですか？いいこいいこ～。\r\n明日も元気な顔を見せてください♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e94a0deb975e6e8a4a7b73c533bc65c3fdc981b70bc6da0c2a1880904f421ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:826c353b9cfa9810ba4cd3a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春の日差しを浴びたお布団に\r\n包まると安らぎますよね～。だから\r\n託児所では、毎日干すんですよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "801d31f0c6195439f2ed3e95891878ebe1e6c3e37f5daf3dc8b99151a29d8411",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ff140a0ad107bbb6dcc530a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おでこの汗ふきふきしましょうか？\r\nあら？ほっぺたも真っ赤に…\r\nぱたぱたして冷まさないと～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f13f1da88117c3fdb602761a9c0f8fc3838681814ad82060b9be3112067f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c333375b6c75060d4880288",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋の夜長のお散歩も乙ですよね～。\r\nお月様に見守られながら、お手手を\r\n繋いで、のんびり、どこまでも～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "abf3e7fed8e96547126d84471b2aff5f7b10c0be9396adda7e78bc6d03f01b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77742d0b37c2b0d99462fd7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、寒くないですか？\r\n忍法ぽかぽかの術なら、\r\nいつでもしてあげますからね～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5189b9d6e2d7561f8212e94a95eed316dcb41a57d200869c8fc96c1b24763b17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:243041fbdd8e7a1ffdcf8438",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいですよね～、分身の術♪\r\nほら、みんなを同時に\r\nいいこいいこできますし～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dc128805cc60b02d1b36b4c7c959d247ef6d59c940344797b85ab72519f4285",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe55f7d75e74644f29b4be8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忍者らしく陰から静かに見守って…\r\nうぅ～、やっぱり我慢できません！\r\n直接たっくさん構いたいです～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50cbd06cb479bd0affe30f4bdb94b7b0b8be1c1766380c0dc095f6e03da66df6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:219770fdb71aff9e0ee14b20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们今天也照自己的步调，\r\n不勉强地努力吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd662796283919e6f9d7cc97df26b3ae5625e474c7dfa71eb9e99f4810d357f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d87a62ff2644ceb7116269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張りますね～",
      "source_fingerprint": "80ff6f5bde34db00ec59654aa3b8afd6a8e07c3cc3c2b3321fb88e0be26832f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e8ba5a2555da1f75762a9a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天做什么好呢？\r\n不要着急，慢慢想就好哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f077dac87f60efc91a217b64dd4197c660e5119e8e5007b64fbf412949245300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73c0352d4674954bf7b7cfab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烦恼该做什么时，就都先尝试看看吧。\r\n没问题的，就算失败了，\r\n也会成为以后的经验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "139309f0b60a044e718350311f2ce9e6e174ebb2af8270cdb918e155bb67f74e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3b8e4ce525ab8177e0539e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别看我这样，跑步时锲而不舍的韧性\r\n可是受到肯定的哦。\r\n要不要在训练的时候测试一下？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeb68a520b4552646b71398d1872fb4d8ec6da4f3c165ba1af9c19decaacc53b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8954c7c8787503019cb56c51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好认真的表情……呵呵，放松一点。\r\n无论是什么样的练习，\r\n我都会让训练员露出笑容的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "024ec9ad0cd239a61cddd567861362d39376f27c9bf290932417efa201e61f0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a3122658d091ec18e02434b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总是很努力的训练员。\r\n如果有什么我能帮忙的地方，\r\n请千万不要客气，要让我知道哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5287709954acda74d1863257b4e87381d04af1eadf5f168efeab3856b1f1b7e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5831e59499170a7c588f7a3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么样的训练安排都没问题的。\r\n因为我是发自内心信任训练员的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5976bf5f1f403c771a7a364511bdb7c8cdddca97e73f7d829ebb9fdcd544f181",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0e025628ee493d053ea7664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行程已经安排好了吗？\r\n呵呵，我很期待训练员\r\n为我制定的项目哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cd49d9fed97e4446021a20544f635e719addaf275582ba44de2024177422c72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c289d8266e9b52c1f4bee824",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好努力练习，\r\n之后让大家吓一跳吧。\r\n我很擅长给人惊喜的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0d58013c157a6ba0075c9780f8bac876eaac3679fe366f0f61d8cf62725329d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3ce09fcd7e74b6bf3c969cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身绷带是用即使激烈运动\r\n也不会散开的方式缠绕。\r\n我也很会用运动贴布的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b3046a96e4969609e6f984e3a3ef0353ae6277c611b71c68a15d10f4572b4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91edb3c2d65d3413156f1206",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才有后辈误会，\r\n问我说「你身上的伤还好吗」。\r\n真是个体贴的孩子呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "efec321e90b28c88972380aca6234f8d362ac8619f403d1ffb0af72f073ba8ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db4a04228755b9b255cca9fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿！\r\n我对你下了想要撒娇的诅咒。\r\n呵呵，想要我摸摸你了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b69bd6b14c3580e7b05e5d2ddce4bcda69d2e25aa547a36b2fe9a7ffd327d26c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:995b11065719c7e8264bc2b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来了～我是Mummy喔～\r\n为了照顾训练员，\r\n从永恒的睡眠中醒来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25ac3fccb236aa8bd60a2b8442df0b8d85bb24cabb48d82cd20c5e4101f4ae6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2677a3addc38e8f92c8d8e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要训练员希望，\r\n我会永远照顾你。\r\n毕竟我是不死之身的Mummy～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ef172acabc7c5fe56ed835fdb597700177bc00a93245a5802b11c1a4be7971f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:622e3df08259e0f692982329",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许我被下了诅咒，\r\n所以才会变得比任何人都想\r\n疼爱训练员也说不定……呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa08395f22e57adde11acf09ed7dc734d21c2c02c68cb1980ba49eec2dce2373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fc3d74be6deffe991ff3cea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんな厳しいトレーニングも\r\nシュシュっと身軽に\r\nこなしますよ～！にんにんっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f38e99560dad210a3adbc9135e35965b28e0181ece01dd4bd80630589a497165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1116b28f5b5531aa96fedd64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつもトレーニングを考えてくれる\r\nトレーナーさんはすごいですね～。\r\nなでなでの術させてほしいです～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72d5f6ff7e8bbac4dfca50071a0d47412e1e90cc480dde7ef9e8fbeb59099869",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89c0ebaf2bb5303e6b0d6eba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝は早起きさんでした～。どんな\r\nメニューを用意してくれたんだろう\r\nって、昨日から待ちきれなくて♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac0d50156595fa260826bd5075ce45dd90f3a31d54796585beed251e6f66b150",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dbc08662e0b68ef3545084b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさんは、いつもやる気に\r\nさせてくれますね～。もしかして、\r\n私に忍術を使ってますか？ふふっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2dfe337698dd8143dee8ec9fec00ea4ec270fdd7e69533b2e16136af435903c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4705eadbf229d5d28984376",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忍びの里から、こっそり参上です。\r\nけど、レースでは目立ってみせます\r\nから、安心してくださいね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56445a57d1e0de1caa5d9d7974ea0411ddcbfe76475eea559803e08b8653d2e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b35fcc5a92bc60470864008e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングが終わったら、今日も\r\n一生懸命なトレーナーさんに\r\nよしよしの術をかけてあげますね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b779d1ba2b50e5bbd5309f7769fae0c2107c3e666c9b37d6b70f6e19d3ed8911",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dae85cb887fc5d9c71b928c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うふふっ、トレーナーさんはもう\r\n忍法甘えたがりの術中にハマって\r\nますよ～。とってもいいこいいこ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2b9c6fd699609e1e4d09d86f5d3c24404a0fcd2609f8c44bc5b557158ec226",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dfe4240cd97dcd4afc962f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不愧是我自豪的训练员呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a69bbbe3ecbd078631cd927af0c53d533d913d66f0042353657c6649e0d67666",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc06f8fbb052e212ff137875",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，我有达到你对我的期许吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d0fd230bea82039b5c8b76f077045e088cabb438ca617abf4be0f5149311c2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b394e16e479802e260635e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉自己达到\r\n比金字塔还高的顶端～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "41153336ce69dde30ab9741ab29c3ea0dfc5de9b362b5ba02ee981d1799cb935",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ddd16f4d6b369231849ab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有种从深沉睡眠中\r\n醒来的感觉♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f49fe8b3038ab1bdd5df0df262094214a5017ad503c525ba60781ee3dce88dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1ceee4eddd5349558de400c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うふふっ、この喜びは忍ばせられませんね～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef420b6fffcc01bab78b36364a6ebca3933e8426c2b97a7d7bebc8c92f216499",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33625d79977e9e6e08272289",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お世話忍法でたっくさんお礼させてください♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7626eb08eb77653a7589912c2481682375763ee88fc654da5ac52b38b2e773e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de84751754e333c72b310f11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……呵呵呵，你也会为我感到高兴吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e72859b35c5615635b009d43b4564553c71e47d7882971a6ac40aa98f5a473c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69ab2ed60edba1086571f2a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这都是训练员一直为我努力的关系～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fae08d41a68941aed0ff250baee01a42e4fd806df46bd178a0a97bdef8efd46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96c8df016f1c76b689942225",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是的，我叫做超级溪流哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b9416ceb13169300e7a4a2cfa64263d3b0599075673ed69d1d6003c933dc86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db216fa538b5968d87ecdfc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，尽量依赖我没关系的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "00b1196f539f9e33040cdf4088d4ea1525d3fe24e5b8055d7cd509c7c09ce121",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d95546f7d4c5f752458cbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以尽情跟我撒娇哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05e3734ad3894ac342b1c7ee2a701fcd7fc23d36e2812bed60e1153189cc2dc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:605f857cc567858659e9f7ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，我重生了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e4a431a52b77ac901148ec9e10753effcc466bd5763e030feea0b3236059364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58145cd0b6c65215f4664795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要疼爱你的诅咒\r\n似乎又变得更强了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a01bc6206eb422db832bf89530d55b51378acd9bf8528f16f5cf76906acb1dca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d7b99c9d4dfa3d4168b730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不必感到害怕哟，\r\n因为我是你的Mummy～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "80b8a7d007f05fe6bf00ac3be177bb932257e279ab9b48a7f2342d6e26f54730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96958ee8ff315f5d0af2d151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是超级溪流。\r\n是你的Mummy喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "44fc116a8bd80f38b72c4069fa424294c3ec9ddb843dc3af4d1a904d0eec2b5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab59e330fe8f6ee62ad13ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うふふ、修行の成果です♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "53b98a9787fc3faaaf305da4ca7443e6e43ac4da3d9f5103c3a38b1cea3c3f85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95207"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
